  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $p_1<p_2<\\cdots$ be a sequence of primes such that $p_{i+1}\\equiv 1\\pmod{p_i}$. Is it true that $ \\lim_k p_k^{1/k}=\\infty? $ Does there exist such a sequence with $ p_k \\leq \\exp(k(\\log k)^{1+o(1)})? $ ",
